                                "sense_id": "7bb3ca7b-212a-3155-b52c-0524bff1e03b",
                                "text": "1883, Andrew Overend, \"Inking apparatus for printing-machines\", US patent US363760, filed 9 November 1883, issued 24 May 1887.\nThe combination, with a fountain-roller and an ink-cylinder, of a ductor movable between said roller and cylinder for delivering ink from one to the other..."
